@startuml
!theme plain
left to right direction
title Proposal Demo Storyboard - What Reviewers Will See

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #19226D

rectangle "1. Fleet Overview\n\nrisk map\nranked drivers\nlatest alerts" as S1 #EAF2FF
rectangle "2. Trip Drill-down\n\nTTC timeline\nDMS timeline\ntelemetry events" as S2 #FFFFFF
rectangle "3. Evidence Moment\n\nroad frame\nin-car frame\nevent explanation" as S3 #FFF7EE
rectangle "4. Score Breakdown\n\nroad risk\ndriver state\nvehicle handling\nlane behavior" as S4 #FFFFFF
rectangle "5. Coaching + Back-to-Car\n\npost-trip tips\nIVI advisory log\nsafety fallback" as S5 #034EA2

S1 --> S2
S2 --> S3
S3 --> S4
S4 --> S5

note bottom
The demo should prove a complete loop:
detect risk -> explain evidence -> score trip -> recommend action -> optionally send safe IVI coaching.
end note

@enduml
